      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.09,
          "en": "We worked a bit on the cart model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.09,
          "end": 5.48,
          "en": "Some things are still missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.48,
          "end": 7.71,
          "en": "For example, we never display our cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.71,
          "end": 10.71,
          "en": "and we also will never really...",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.71,
          "end": 13.43,
          "en": "We're not able to delete an item from the cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.43,
          "end": 15.55,
          "en": "but let's ignore that for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.55,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "Let's instead focus on editing a product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "We get the edit-product.ejs file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 23.61,
          "en": "and in the end, what I wanna do in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "is I want to render the same form I have for add-product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 32.6,
          "en": "The difference will be that I want to pre-populate that form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.6,
          "end": 35.413,
          "en": "with the values of the product I wanna edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.4,
          "end": 40.92,
          "en": "Now, if I'm using the same HTML code in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.92,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "it would make sense to reuse the same template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 47.057,
          "en": "If you ever plan on using a different one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.057,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "it doesn't, but here it makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 52.4,
          "en": "So what I'll do is I'll take my add-product.ejs code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.4,
          "end": 54.08,
          "en": "and move it into edit-product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.08,
          "end": 56.52,
          "en": "because I find this to be the more generic name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.52,
          "end": 59.66,
          "en": "and I'll delete the add-product.ejs file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.66,
          "end": 61.72,
          "en": "So now we just have edit-product.ejs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.72,
          "end": 64.193,
          "en": "with all the HTML code in there that we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 66.31,
          "en": "Now, first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.31,
          "end": 69.58,
          "en": "that means that I have to load that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.58,
          "end": 74.15,
          "en": "in admin.js when we load getAddProduct.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.15,
          "end": 78.47,
          "en": "I no longer need the add-product path here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.47,
          "end": 81.03999999999999,
          "en": "I need edit-product here only.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.03999999999999,
          "end": 83.37,
          "en": "The path down there can stay add-product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.37,
          "end": 85.02,
          "en": "because that is what we use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.02,
          "end": 88.2,
          "en": "for highlighting a certain navigation item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.2,
          "end": 89.28399999999999,
          "en": "By the way, we can get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.28399999999999,
          "end": 92.793,
          "en": "of these additional information pieces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 93.69,
          "end": 95.50999999999999,
          "en": "So now this should still work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.50999999999999,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "If I click on Add Product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 99.22,
          "en": "I still see that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.22,
          "end": 100.94,
          "en": "So that's looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 100.94,
          "end": 103.87,
          "en": "However, for editing a product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.87,
          "end": 105.64,
          "en": "I now also want to have a route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.64,
          "end": 107.8,
          "en": "and I wanna use that same view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.8,
          "end": 110.97,
          "en": "So I'll copy that route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.97,
          "end": 113.4,
          "en": "and add it maybe below postAddProduct",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.4,
          "end": 114.87299999999999,
          "en": "to keep these two together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 116.08,
          "end": 119.723,
          "en": "And here I will have getEditProduct as a action name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.85,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "And I also wanna render edit-product here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 127.06,
          "en": "The difference is that here I plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.06,
          "end": 130.53,
          "en": "on passing in my product information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.53,
          "end": 132.11,
          "en": "But the problem is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.11,
          "end": 135.03,
          "en": "how should I reach this controller action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.03,
          "end": 135.87,
          "en": "And my idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 139.35,
          "en": "is that since I already have my Edit button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.35,
          "end": 144.02,
          "en": "if I click that, I don't wanna call edit-product like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.02,
          "end": 146.95,
          "en": "I also want to add the ID of the product I wanna edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.95,
          "end": 148.5,
          "en": "So if I grab a real ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 151.62,
          "en": "from my products.json file like this one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.62,
          "end": 153.45,
          "en": "then I would have that in the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 154.55,
          "en": "and if I load this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 154.55,
          "end": 157.34,
          "en": "now I want to have the form pre-populated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.34,
          "end": 158.89,
          "en": "with the data for this product,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.89,
          "end": 161.03,
          "en": "and if I hit the Save button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 161.03,
          "end": 163.18,
          "en": "I, of course, don't want to create this product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 163.18,
          "end": 164.993,
          "en": "but simply edit the existing one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 165.95,
          "end": 169.86,
          "en": "Now, this means that I need two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 169.86,
          "end": 172.07,
          "en": "The ID, I need to pass that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.07,
          "end": 176.23,
          "en": "and the information that I want to edit a product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 176.23,
          "end": 178.22,
          "en": "instead of create it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 178.22,
          "end": 181.63,
          "en": "Well, if we go to our admin routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 181.63,
          "end": 183.75,
          "en": "we can add a new route, first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 183.75,
          "end": 186.6,
          "en": "this edit-product route here with the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.6,
          "end": 188.32,
          "en": "and you learned how that works actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 190.84,
          "en": "You can add a new route here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.84,
          "end": 194.67,
          "en": "Get route will be at slash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.67,
          "end": 197.16,
          "en": "and then here the /admin is available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 197.16,
          "end": 199.47,
          "en": "for all routes in the admin.js file anyways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 199.47,
          "end": 200.39,
          "en": "as you know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 200.39,
          "end": 202.64,
          "en": "So it's just edit-product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 202.64,
          "end": 204.38,
          "en": "and then the ID, and again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 204.38,
          "end": 207.68,
          "en": "this is a variable, a dynamic path segment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 207.68,
          "end": 209.28,
          "en": "indicated with a colon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 209.28,
          "end": 211.62,
          "en": "And then we can load the adminController",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 212.57,
          "end": 217.57,
          "en": "and there the getEditProduct action we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 217.7,
          "end": 219.44,
          "en": "So this is step number one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 219.44,
          "end": 222.12,
          "en": "And actually, we now already can go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 222.12,
          "end": 225.48,
          "en": "to our admin.js controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.48,
          "end": 229.15,
          "en": "and here we obviously know that we wanna edit a product.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 229.15,
          "end": 230.04,
          "en": "So what we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 230.04,
          "end": 234.32999999999998,
          "en": "is we can pass an additional information field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 234.32999999999998,
          "end": 238.26,
          "en": "to our view, editing, and set this to true maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 238.26,
          "end": 240.19,
          "en": "so that we can check this with the if condition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 240.19,
          "end": 242.05,
          "en": "to find out, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 242.05,
          "end": 244.54,
          "en": "if upon clicking that Save button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 244.54,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "we should try to add the product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 247.87,
          "en": "and send a request to that route",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 247.87,
          "end": 251.2,
          "en": "or try to edit it and send it to a different route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 251.2,
          "end": 256.2,
          "en": "But let's say we want to get an additional confirmation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 256.51,
          "end": 259.04,
          "en": "by ensuring that people have to pass us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 259.04,
          "end": 261.9,
          "en": "a so-called query parameter in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 261.9,
          "end": 264.56,
          "en": "A query parameter can be added to any URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 264.56,
          "end": 266,
          "en": "by adding a question mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 266,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "and then a key-value pair, separated by an equal sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 272.1,
          "en": "like edit equals true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 272.1,
          "end": 274.4,
          "en": "And you can have multiple query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 274.4,
          "end": 276.40999999999997,
          "en": "by separating them with ampersands.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 276.40999999999997,
          "end": 281.40999999999997,
          "en": "So we could also have title equals new, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 284.99,
          "end": 286.78,
          "en": "So this is possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 286.78,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "and this is so-called optional data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 289.2,
          "end": 292.27,
          "en": "The path here, the route which gets reached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 292.27,
          "end": 295,
          "en": "is determined by the part up to the question mark.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 295,
          "end": 297.51,
          "en": "So you don't need to add any information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 297.51,
          "end": 299.34000000000003,
          "en": "about query parameters you might get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 299.34000000000003,
          "end": 300.6,
          "en": "to your routes file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 300.6,
          "end": 302.64,
          "en": "These paths are not affected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 302.64,
          "end": 305.266,
          "en": "But you can always check for query parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 305.266,
          "end": 307.26,
          "en": "in your controllers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 307.26,
          "end": 311.07,
          "en": "So here we can check if const editMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 311.07,
          "end": 314.38,
          "en": "if this is set by going to our request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 314.38,
          "end": 316.53,
          "en": "and there will be a query object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 316.53,
          "end": 319.85,
          "en": "This is also created and managed by Express.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 319.85,
          "end": 322.47,
          "en": "And you can access your data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 322.47,
          "end": 326.51,
          "en": "by simply trying to access the keys you got",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 326.51,
          "end": 327.93,
          "en": "in your query parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 327.93,
          "end": 330.29,
          "en": "So for this query parameter that was added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 330.29,
          "end": 331.613,
          "en": "you could check for edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 332.466,
          "end": 333.48,
          "en": "This would be your key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 333.48,
          "end": 335.61,
          "en": "So I can try to access edit here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 335.61,
          "end": 338.61,
          "en": "and only if this is set somewhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 338.61,
          "end": 340.22,
          "en": "in the list of query parameters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 340.22,
          "end": 342.95,
          "en": "which can be separated with ampersands as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 342.95,
          "end": 344.09000000000003,
          "en": "if this is set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 344.09000000000003,
          "end": 346.69,
          "en": "then I will get the value which is set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 346.69,
          "end": 349.36,
          "en": "So now I would have true in editMode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 349.36,
          "end": 351.49,
          "en": "And if I don't have it, if I don't find it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 351.49,
          "end": 353.09000000000003,
          "en": "I'll simply have undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 353.09000000000003,
          "end": 355.82,
          "en": "which conveniently is also treated as false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 355.82,
          "end": 357.58,
          "en": "in a Boolean check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 357.58,
